{"id":"n46952-1-7","stage":4,"title":"대폭 · 大幅","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n46952-1-7-1","ko":"기름값이 대폭으로 오른다며?","zh":"听说油价要大幅上涨吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기름값이","meaning":"油价、燃油费用","explanation":"기름값：油价、燃油费用；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기름값","audio":"/audio/22cc502591fef87bc41e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:기름값:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"기름값","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"대폭으로","meaning":"大幅，宽幅","explanation":"대폭：大幅，宽幅；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"대폭","audio":"/audio/2c9c72231c2283f57550.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46952","senseId":"1","lemma":"대폭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오른다며?","meaning":"上升，上涨","explanation":"오르다：上升，上涨；ㄴ다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"10","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"22cc502591fef87b","term":"기름값","zh":"油价、燃油费用","audio":"/audio/22cc502591fef87bc41e.mp3","definition":"购买燃油的价格或费用。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"2c9c72231c2283f5","term":"대폭","zh":"大幅，宽幅","audio":"/audio/2c9c72231c2283f57550.mp3","entryId":"46952","definition":"大的幅度；或指广阔的范围。","pronunciation":["대ː폭"]},{"id":"8fdeb9822b3fa061","term":"오르다","zh":"上升，上涨","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3","entryId":"69518","definition":"价格、数值、温度、成绩等比以前多或高。","pronunciation":["오르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8415b057c21d04d107c3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n46952-1-7-2","ko":"응. 십 퍼센트 이상 오를 것 같아.","zh":"对，估计会上涨10%以上。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"십","meaning":"十","explanation":"십：十","readings":[{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28847